<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="dim">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>About - Climate Solutions</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <div class="container mx-auto p-4">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <div class="hero bg-base-200 rounded-lg my-8">
      <div class="hero-content text-center">
        <div class="max-w-md">
          <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold">About</h1>
          <p class="py-6">Learn more about this project and its creator</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- About Content Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 my-8">
      <!-- Left Column - Image -->
      <div class="flex justify-center items-start">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498049860654-af1a5c566876?w=500" alt="Profile" class="rounded-lg shadow-2xl max-w-full h-auto">
      </div>

      <!-- Right Column - About Text -->
      <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">About Me</h2>
        <p class="text-lg mb-4">
          Hello! I'm Jaspreet Kaur, I'm currently in Seneca Polytechnic pursuing my studies in Computer programming and analysis.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg mb-4">
          I'm passionate about creating meaningful web applications that can make a positive impact on the world. This project showcases climate solutions and innovative approaches to addressing environmental challenges.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg mb-4">
          Currently, I'm taking courses in Web Programming, Database management and Software development. In my free time, I enjoy learning new technologies, working on personal projects and exploring the latest trends in web development.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg">
          This assignment combines my interests in technology and sustainability, allowing me to present important climate solutions in an accessible and user-friendly format.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>